{"product_id":"juul2-basic-kit","title":"JUUL2 Basic Kit","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNow with more cigarette-like satisfaction, JUUL2 is an easy-to-use, next generation JUUL device designed for adult smokers looking for an alternative to cigarettes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe all-day battery has up to 20% more capacity. The JUUL2 device kit comes with a device and charging dock.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe JUUL2 device is designed to only function with authentic JUUL2 pods\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003emanufactured by Juul Labs. JUUL2 pods contain nicotine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eJUUL2pods not included and sold separately. \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFeatures\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIntegrated Battery: 250mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eLight indicator for charge status, battery level, e-liquid level and pod authenticity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eCompatible with the JUUL APP only available for Android™ platform\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eKit includes\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eRechargeable JUUL2 device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eUSB charging dock\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652480442423,"sku":"JL2 Basic Kit","price":4600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/juul2-device-kit-new.jpg?v=1746632017","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul2-basic-kit","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




